From abf3f6272054b6918f373896221ea00fffbbbcf1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nyall Dawson <nyall.dawson@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:52:25 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] [feature] Add support for picture annotation items in 3d
 maps

Extends the existing support for showing marker and text annotations
as 3D billboards, and now shows picture annotation items as 3d
billboards too.

There is an option to show these as either view independent, fixed
size billboards (just like markers and text), or as perspective
correct sizes (eg like any other 3d item you can zoom in or out
of).

The sizes of the 3d billboards is set manually, allowing the size
to be set to one that makes sense in the 3d map (as opposed to strictly
following the 2d size)
